  "title": "Write the loss yourself: DPO on preference pairs",
  "technique": "Preference · custom loss",
  "summary": "DPO is not one of the service's losses. The loop computes it in your process from forward log-probs and trains it through importance_sampling at ratio 1. Swap in IPO or a hinge, or write your own.",
