    "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b",
    "duration_s": 149,
    "cost_usd": 0.00203,
    "note": "In the reference run, loss fell from 0.69 to 0.0001 and all preference pairs were ranked correctly. Greedy decoding still produced none of the chosen answers (0/8), and the answers differed from the base model's. The IPO and hinge runs also remained at 0/8. Improved preference ranking alone did not improve answer generation on this dataset."
